name Catalan (Rossellonese)
language ca-ro

// Ported from upstream PR espeak-ng/espeak-ng#2513 (c-armentano,
// "Added 2 new catalan accents", open). The PR as submitted references
// `phonemes ca-ro` / `dictrules 1 6` but ships no ph_catalan_ro table and
// ca_rules defines only ?1-?4, so those selectors would be inert/broken.
// This port wires the voice to the existing `ca` table with the base
// general-eastern rule (?1) so it builds and sounds like Central Catalan
// until per-accent phoneme/rules land upstream.
phonemes ca
dictrules 1
